        "title": "不光 + first point, 还 + further point",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "不光…还… adds another point beyond the first. It does not negate the first point despite the 不 inside the connector.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他不光会说，还会写。",
                "pinyin": "tā bùguāng huì shuō ， hái huì xiě 。",
                "meaning": "He can not only speak but also write.",
                "audio": "dff3f91a9f0d5e8b13682f5fb6e2c5e34f12db9287fad140519284630a706381"
              },
              {
                "text": "她不光帮助我，还帮助他。",
                "pinyin": "tā bùguāng bāngzhù wǒ ， hái bāngzhù tā 。",
                "meaning": "She helps not only me but also him.",
                "audio": "da58ea4e46305cac0565cc0ecb9d8abe7f68ad4a1150917a5ec4e47fb7c1f378"
              }
            ]
